    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8067-af66-cf1892c0b608",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T04:27:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T04:29:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Welcome. We are gathered today to bear witness to the marriage of Adrian Smith and Venki Kumar.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Welcome. We are gathered today to bear witness to the marriage of Adrian Smith and Venki Kumar.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-800d-b587-f8c25af922aa",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T04:30:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T06:30:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Marriage is a sacred contract. It’s a commitment, formalized here this afternoon, but then extending to the rest of their shared lifetime.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Marriage is a sacred contract. It’s a commitment, formalized here this afternoon, but then extending to the rest of their shared lifetime.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-80cc-ad5f-f2704e6536c7",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T06:30:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T06:34:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "It’s a promise intended to be costly, binding, permanent. A promise to be made when lived experience and careful reflection and burning passion all point in a single direction: that there’s no other choice, that this one beautiful amazing being merits complete devotion for the rest of your life.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "It’s a promise intended to be costly, binding, permanent. A promise to be made when lived experience and careful reflection and burning passion all point in a single direction: that there’s no other choice, that this one beautiful amazing being merits complete devotion for the rest of your life.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8098-9062-d5043d31ab7f",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T06:27:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T06:36:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "We cannot always guess what life will bring, but after today, Adrian and Venki will have this promise as a recourse against all uncertainty.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "We cannot always guess what life will bring, but after today, Adrian and Venki will have this promise as a recourse against all uncertainty.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8072-935e-e8b18c0878c5",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T04:50:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T05:08:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "This is not a promise they make in secret; it is one they undertake in front of their community. We, the friends and family of the couple, have traveled here from near and far, in order that Adrian and Venki may understand that we support their love and their union.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "This is not a promise they make in secret; it is one they undertake in front of their community. We, the friends and family of the couple, have traveled here from near and far, in order that Adrian and Venki may understand that we support their love and their union.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-80b3-ba87-ed1d3aca0d20",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T05:42:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T06:27:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "This union goes beyond two individuals; every marriage represents the joining of two families. Through this ceremony, and with the blessing of each family, we prepare for this couple to begin a family of their own. ",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "This union goes beyond two individuals; every marriage represents the joining of two families. Through this ceremony, and with the blessing of each family, we prepare for this couple to begin a family of their own. ",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
