    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-809b-883c-ed4c5431b6e1",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T05:32:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T05:41:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Marriage a one-way door. At I first I wanted to say, a door, passing through which forever changes your relationship. But that didn’t feel true — when people ask me how I felt just after getting married, I remember replying “eh it’s pretty much the same, the big milestones are actually moving in together, and (I imagine) having a kid”.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Marriage a one-way door. At I first I wanted to say, a door, passing through which forever changes your relationship. But that didn’t feel true — when people ask me how I felt just after getting married, I remember replying “eh it’s pretty much the same, the big milestones are actually moving in together, and (I imagine) having a kid”.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "35aa6e41-f23e-80d7-8a9d-c1f86c7fc703",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "35aa6e41-f23e-8059-b3bd-fea6199d4b47"
      },
      "created_time": "2026-05-08T05:41:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2026-05-08T05:42:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "But what is true, is: it’s a decision, intended to be costly, tying ourselves to a mast, because lived experience and careful reflection and burning passion all point in a single direction: that there’s no other reasonable choice to make, that this one beautiful amazing being merits complete devotion for the rest of your life.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "But what is true, is: it’s a decision, intended to be costly, tying ourselves to a mast, because lived experience and careful reflection and burning passion all point in a single direction: that there’s no other reasonable choice to make, that this one beautiful amazing being merits complete devotion for the rest of your life.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
