              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I think I met Panda first, I think back when Elicit was still Ought? First at a Manifest, perhaps, and then repeatedly through Taco Tuesdays. He’s always been kind, warm, candid, genuine, someone whose every interaction with others makes them better off.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "color": "default"
      }
