            "text": {
              "content": "I also keep wanting to crack jokes, or at least insert some wry observations about the silliness of finding myself as an officiant - as a kid, I hated all kinds of ceremony, graduation and weddings and funerals. Probably, everyone will be happier if I leave such remarks in my notes.",
